# Ash Enterprise: 1 - Resources

Effort: **light** — one concept, no exercises. *You'll feel a resource be a description you can read rather than code you must follow.*

```elixir
Application.put_env(:ash, :validate_domain_resource_inclusion?, false)
Application.put_env(:ash, :validate_domain_config_inclusion?, false)
Application.put_env(:ash, :default_string_length_count, :codepoints)
Mix.install([{:ash, "~> 3.0"}], consolidate_protocols: false)
```

